This requires a suitable mechanical actuator or adjustable-resistance mechanism. Sensors alone cannot physically change the movement of the leg.

My recommendation: Make personalised gait intelligence and smart socket monitoring your two primary smart systems. Treat mechanical adaptation as the next development stage.

